# Things you can look at (Inspectable, #185). Each section is one thing,
# named by the Inspectable's Lines. Interact plays it; nothing else happens.

~ start
narrator: Nothing much to see.

# The navigation room's chart, on the chart table (#185). A world map that
# opens drawn, like a book, is #192.
~ grave_chart
narrator: An old chart. Someone has marked a route through the *Grave of the Lanterns*.
narrator: The destination appears to be an island somewhere beyond the fog. Its name is lost to age and damp: you can't make it out.

~ water_jug
narrator: Dry. A ring of rainwater marks the wood beneath it.
-> END
